<section class="brand-story" id="about"><div class="story-mark"><span class="micro">END CULTURE / OUR STORY</span><strong>EC®</strong></div><div class="story-copy"><p class="story-lead">END THE ORDINARY.</p><h2>MADE BY US.<br>MADE TO BE WORN.</h2><p>END CULTURE started with two cousins, a shared obsession with clothes, and the same thought: <strong>why not make what we actually want to wear?</strong></p><p>We're not interested in putting our name on something just for the sake of it. Every piece starts with what we like, what we'd buy and, most importantly, what we'd wear ourselves.</p><p>That means good design, considered details and no compromise on quality. <strong>If we wouldn't wear it, we won't release it.</strong></p><p>END CULTURE isn't built around endless collections. We work in limited drops — releasing pieces when we believe they're right, not simply because the calendar says we need something new.</p><div class="story-signoff">TWO COUSINS. OUR TASTE. OUR STANDARD.</div></div></section>
